{"step_index":1039,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:31:22Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:31:22+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T01:31:28+02:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n{\"step_index\":1113,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"GENERIC\",\"status\":\"RUNNING\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T23:31:20Z\",\"content\":\"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:31:20+02:00\\nTool is running as a background task with task id: f458c9cf-488d-4cd8-8365-7c4e4b16e3f9/task-1113\\nTask Description: /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/.venv/bin/python -u -c '\\nimport networkx as nx\\nimport itertools\\n\\n# We can generate all connected graphs on 8 vertices or search trees and low degree graphs\\n# Actually, networkx has geng or graph generators, or we can use random generation\\n# But wait! What graphs have radius >= 3 on n=8?\\n# Diam >= 3, up to 7.\\n# Let us search among all trees on n=8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16!\\nprint(\\\"Testing trees up to n=18...\\\")\\nfor n in range(8, 19):\\n    trees = list(nx.nonisomorphic_trees(n))\\n    for T in trees:\\n        r = nx.radius(T)\\n        if r <= 1: continue\\n        # compute roman domination of T using tree DP or pulp\\n        # Fast Roman domination for T\\n        import pulp\\n        prob = pulp.LpProblem(\\\"R\\\", pulp.LpMinimize)\\n        nodes = list(T.nodes())\\n        x = {v: pulp.LpVariable(f\\\"x_{v}\\\", cat=\\\"Binary\\\") for v in nodes}\\n        y = {v: pulp.LpVariable(f\\\"y_{v}\\\", cat=\\\"Binary\\\") for v in nodes}\\n        prob += pulp.lpSum(x[v] + 2*y[v] for v in nodes)\\n        for v in nodes:\\n            prob += x[v] + y[v] + pulp.lpSum(y[u] for u in T.neighbors(v)) >= 1\\n            prob += x[v] + y[v] <= 1\\n        prob.solve(pulp.PULP_CBC_CMD(msg=0))\\n        rom = int(pulp.value(prob.objective))\\n        if r + 1 > rom:\\n            print(f\\\"COUNTEREXAMPLE TREE! n={n}, r={r}, rom={rom}\\\")\\n            exit(0)\\n    print(f\\\"All {len(trees)} trees on n={n} passed.\\\")\\n\\nprint(\\\"All trees up to n=18 passed!\\\")\\n'\\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/f458c9cf-488d-4cd8-8365-7c4e4b16e3f9/.system_generated/tasks/task-1113.log\\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\\n DO NOTHING ELSE.\"}\r\n{\"step_index\":1114,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T23:31:25Z\",\"content\":\"I will wait for the tree verification script to complete.\"}\r\n\n"}
